[22-Dec-2025 19:37:17 UTC] WordPress database error Unknown column 'messages' in 'field list' for query UPDATE `wp_aethos_conversations` SET `messages` = 'a:2:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:4:\"user\";s:7:\"content\";s:40:\"Are there any murals at Bushwick Houses?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432233998;}i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:9:\"assistant\";s:7:\"content\";s:515:\"Yes, a new mural was unveiled at Bushwick Houses on November 14. The mural celebrates community pride and collaboration. It features the phrase \"We Belong Here\" and was created with the involvement of young Bushwick Houses residents, community members, designers from the Bleacher Report, lead muralist Sally Rumble, and other partners. The mural is a colorful representation of community pride and new friendships. A community paint day was also held to involve residents of all ages in bringing the mural to life.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432237479;}}', `duration` = 20, `updated_at` = '2025-12-22 19:37:17' WHERE `id` = 2 made by require('wp-blog-header.php'), wp, WP->main, WP->parse_request, do_action_ref_array('parse_request'), WP_Hook->do_action, WP_Hook->apply_filters, rest_api_loaded, WP_REST_Server->serve_request, WP_REST_Server->dispatch, WP_REST_Server->respond_to_request, Aethos_REST_Controller->save_conversation
[22-Dec-2025 19:39:07 UTC] WordPress database error Unknown column 'messages' in 'field list' for query UPDATE `wp_aethos_conversations` SET `messages` = 'a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:4:\"user\";s:7:\"content\";s:40:\"Are there any murals at Bushwick Houses?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432233998;}i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:9:\"assistant\";s:7:\"content\";s:515:\"Yes, a new mural was unveiled at Bushwick Houses on November 14. The mural celebrates community pride and collaboration. It features the phrase \"We Belong Here\" and was created with the involvement of young Bushwick Houses residents, community members, designers from the Bleacher Report, lead muralist Sally Rumble, and other partners. The mural is a colorful representation of community pride and new friendships. A community paint day was also held to involve residents of all ages in bringing the mural to life.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432237479;}i:2;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:4:\"user\";s:7:\"content\";s:40:\"what else is going on in Bushwick Houses\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432343596;}i:3;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:9:\"assistant\";s:7:\"content\";s:785:\"In addition to the new mural that was recently unveiled at Bushwick Houses, there are ongoing activities and programs that take place within the community. These may include events organized by the Bushwick Houses Resident Association, community workshops, recreational activities, educational programs, and social services provided by organizations like the Grand Street Settlement, which operates the Bushwick-Hylan Community Center. The community may also participate in initiatives related to neighborhood safety and well-being, as mentioned with the presence of the Los Sures Neighborhood Safety Coalition at the mural unveiling event. Residents of Bushwick Houses come together to foster a sense of community pride and engagement through various collaborative efforts and events.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432347374;}}', `duration` = 130, `updated_at` = '2025-12-22 19:39:07' WHERE `id` = 3 made by require('wp-blog-header.php'), wp, WP->main, WP->parse_request, do_action_ref_array('parse_request'), WP_Hook->do_action, WP_Hook->apply_filters, rest_api_loaded, WP_REST_Server->serve_request, WP_REST_Server->dispatch, WP_REST_Server->respond_to_request, Aethos_REST_Controller->save_conversation
[22-Dec-2025 19:45:00 UTC] WordPress database error Unknown column 'messages' in 'field list' for query UPDATE `wp_aethos_conversations` SET `messages` = 'a:2:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:4:\"user\";s:7:\"content\";s:25:\"what is the PACT project?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432696521;}i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"role\";s:9:\"assistant\";s:7:\"content\";s:778:\"The PACT project stands for \"Permanent Affordability Commitment Together.\" It is a program undertaken by NYCHA (New York City Housing Authority) to transition public housing developments from traditional Section 9 assistance to Project-Based Section 8. This transition unlocks funding for comprehensive repairs, building upgrades, enhanced property management, and social services. The PACT program aims to improve the quality of life for residents in NYCHA developments by addressing capital needs, rehabilitating apartments, and enhancing shared spaces and building infrastructure. Residents have a role in selecting PACT partners and participating in the planning and implementation process to ensure that the renovations meet their needs and improve their living conditions.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";i:1766432700657;}}', `duration` = 35, `updated_at` = '2025-12-22 19:45:00' WHERE `id` = 4 made by require('wp-blog-header.php'), wp, WP->main, WP->parse_request, do_action_ref_array('parse_request'), WP_Hook->do_action, WP_Hook->apply_filters, rest_api_loaded, WP_REST_Server->serve_request, WP_REST_Server->dispatch, WP_REST_Server->respond_to_request, Aethos_REST_Controller->save_conversation
